body:
Do get this app and do pay a 2.99 (or 3.99 I don&#39;t remember) to get the full version.

1. It tracks the consecutive days that you achieve for each of your goal; 
2. You can set a number of times to do daily for each goal;
3. You can set and track the &#34;amount&#34;, i.e., length of time, of each goal you fulfill;
4. Your achievements for each habit can be visualized in a calendar + hologram style...
